creatures:
- name: Ancient Copper Dragon
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 21  
      **Hit Points** 367 (rollable(dice=21d20 + 147,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Climb 40 ft., Fly 80 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+15,label=+15,dicelabel=Initiative) (25)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=27)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=25)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=22)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Deception rollable(dice=1d20+13,label=+13,dicelabel=Deception Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+17,label=+17,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** acid  
      **Senses** blindsight 60 ft., darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 27  
      **Languages** Common, Draconic  
      **Challenge** 21 (33,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +7  

      ## Traits

      ***Legendary Resistance (4/Day, or 5/Day in Lair).*** If the dragon fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The dragon makes three Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of (A) Slowing Breath or (B) Spellcasting to cast [Mind Spike](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619038-mind-spike) (level 5 version).

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+15,label=+15,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 15 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d10+8,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=2d8,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Acid damage.

      ***Acid Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Acid Breath])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 22, each creature in an 90-foot-long, 10-foot-wide ***Line***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=14d8,dicelabel=Damage [Acid Breath]) Acid damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ***Slowing Breath.*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 22, each creature in a 90-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* The target can't take Reactions; its ***Speed*** is halved; and it can take either an action or a ***Bonus Action*** on its turn, not both. This effect lasts until the end of its next turn.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The dragon casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 21):

      At will: [Detect Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619097-detect-magic), [Mind Spike](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619038-mind-spike) (level 5 version), [Minor Illusion](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619039-minor-illusion), [Shapechange](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618982-shapechange) (Beast or Humanoid form only, no ***Temporary Hit Points*** gained from the spell, and no Concentration or ***Temporary Hit Points*** required to maintain the spell)  
      1/day each: [Greater Restoration](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618961-greater-restoration), [Major Image](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619025-major-image), [Project Image](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618903-project-image)  

      ## Legendary Actions

      *Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature's turn, The Ancient Copper Dragon can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The Ancient Copper Dragon regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.*

      ***Giggling Magic.*** *Charisma Saving Throw:* DC 21, one creature the dragon can see within 120 feet. *Failure:* rollable(dice=9d6,dicelabel=Damage [Giggling Magic]) Psychic damage. Until the end of its next turn, the target rolls rollable(dice=1d8,dicelabel=Giggling Magic) whenever it makes an ability check or attack roll and subtracts the number rolled from the ***D20 Test***. *Failure or Success:* The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.

      ***Mind Jolt.*** The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast [Mind Spike](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619038-mind-spike) (level 5 version). The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.

      ***Pounce.*** The dragon moves up to half its ***Speed***, and it makes one Rend attack.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Gargantuan Dragon (Metallic), Chaotic Good*  
    **Challenge** 21
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024ancientcopperdragon
  status: 1

